msgid "[UNBOUND]"
msgstr "[未绑定]"

msgid "- Requires SiON/GDSiON-based software to play."
msgstr "- 需要基于 SiON/GDSiON 的软件才能播放。"

msgid "- Volume is normalized, which may result in minimal precision loss."
msgstr "- 已进行音量标准化，可能造成极少量精度损失。"

msgid "- Supports only 15 unique instruments + 1 drumkit."
msgstr "- 仅支持 15 个独立乐器加 1 个鼓组。"

msgid "- Non-MIDI Bosca instruments are converted to their closest MIDI approximation."
msgstr "- 非 MIDI 的 Bosca 乐器会转换为最接近的 MIDI 音色。"

msgid "- Low-pass filter and instrument recording are not supported."
msgstr "- 不支持低通滤波器和乐器录制。"

msgid "- Supports up to 256 bars in the arrangement."
msgstr "- 编曲最多支持 256 个小节。"

msgid "- Only one sample per instrument is rendered, which may affect the playback."
msgstr "- 每种乐器仅渲染一个采样，可能影响回放效果。"

msgid "- Universally supported by media players, music and video production software, game engines, etc."
msgstr "- 媒体播放器、音视频制作软件、游戏引擎等普遍支持。"

msgid "- What you hear is what you get."
msgstr "- 所听即所得。"

msgid "External formats may be incompatible with Bosca in various ways. Import is done on the best-effort basis.\nBut feel free to experiment!"
msgstr "外部格式可能在不同方面与 Bosca 不兼容；导入会尽力完成。\n不过，欢迎自由尝试！"

msgid "Learn about some of the more\nadvanced features:"
